/","line":59},{"title":"Charles Preuss – Mapping the Oregon Trail","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/charles-preuss/","line":61},{"title":"Dr. Marcus Whitman – Missionary to the Cayuse","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/wa-marcuswhitman/","line":63},{"title":"Nathaniel Jarvis Wyeth – Explorer, Fur Trader & Inventor","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/nathaniel-wyeth/","line":65},{"title":"Landmarks Along the Oregon Trail","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/landmarks-oregon-trail/","line":69},{"title":"Independence, Missouri – Queen City of the Trails","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/mo-independence/","line":71},{"title":"Kansas City","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/kansas-city-missouri/","line":73},{"title":"Missouri","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/missouri/","line":73},{"title":"Vieux Crossing","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/vieux-crossing-kansas/","line":75},{"title":"Alcove Spring","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/alcove-spring/","line":77},{"title":"Rock Creek Station","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/ne-rockcreek/","line":79},{"title":"Nebraska","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/nebraska/","line":79},{"title":"Fort McPherson","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/fort-mcpherson/","line":81},{"title":"Fort Kearny","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/ne-fortkearny/","line":83},{"title":"Oregon Trail Through the Platte River Valley","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/ne-plattevalleyoregontrail/","line":87},{"title":"Scotts Bluff","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/ne-scottsbluff/","line":89},{"title":"Oregon-California Trail Across Wyoming","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/wy-orgcaltrail/","line":91},{"title":"Fort Laramie","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/wy-fortlaramie/","line":93},{"title":"Register Cliff","target":"https://www.legendsofamerica.com/wy-registercliff/","line":95},{"title":"Guernsey Ruts (Deep